,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Lc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E98592FF-03A6-4099-87D3-D7AF79511D33","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"GOPATH で開発するのには戻れないくらいには優秀ですね","ts":"1629873015.152600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z+Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"074152fa-4b2f-4718-be4f-f18992cd38f4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Goそんなに優れてるんです？","ts":"1629872979.151300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RPjCX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2941a5a-daa3-4b3b-96fb-175e2d74871c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"やはり人類が本当に求めていたのはGo Modules……！","ts":"1629872913.151000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ybof"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5a2ed8e-3a85-4f83-8bdc-ca2fb4037cc5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"プロジェクト全体の厳格な型チェックとかテストもPR段階で気付くようにしとけばいいくらいの気持ちがある","ts":"1629872894.150500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4JLrt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9606a733-86e5-4001-ad20-5b7b4f4bfed8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"`deno tidy \"**/*.{tsx?,jsx?}\" --ignore=mod.ts` があると理想かもって感じですかね。","ts":"1629872889.150400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8rgl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11a87ee5-1b0b-40f1-82d8-8e7dba256015","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁその手のはCIでチェックして気付けば直す程度でいいと思います","ts":"1629872870.149700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WcXF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46192c96-302c-42b1-8888-93896a6f624b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"やれはするだろうけどlinterに乗っからないとやってられない感じになりそう","ts":"1629872825.148800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pBK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8090e701-b7e4-489d-9282-13c45b6e4602","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"やるとしたらユーザーが指定した範囲をスキャンして、その中でどこからも参照されていないexportがあれば警告するツールをサードパーティで提供するという形になるかな","ts":"1629872759.147800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4FU1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"097b3633-1a6f-4222-afda-4dfa2be37378","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"（そもそもtidyで消える気はする）","ts":"1629872665.146800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qr+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"941c176f-4c61-48fa-897b-35f6c3e4739f","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Goは `go.mod` に書かれてるけどimportされてない奴とか怒ってくれるんでしたっけ（linterによると思いますけど）","ts":"1629872644.146500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rld"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e90f1bb3-c812-4ce8-a434-c9a1708e1333","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"tsconfigの場所くらいが落とし所ですかね(これも可変なのであれ)","ts":"1629872603.145900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rUn=q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e97017b-e97d-4e58-8cff-f1c64a714c6b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"プロジェクトの区切りの定義をDenoは持たないので公式で提供するのは無理という意味で","ts":"1629872553.144400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U8R597E9H","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4CSRU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"568d20f1-c0c3-4530-aab9-7c2fa4361b7d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ただ deno においてプロジェクトとは。。。という感じもあるので、tsconfig.json とかとうまく噛み合えばって感じになるのかなあ。","ts":"1629872545.144100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0LUI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"688d2f77-10e2-46db-a55d-d16bf7ea37ff","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そもそも仕様上unused exportを検出するの無理ではという思いがある","ts":"1629872513.142900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wtm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fef4ddfa-de58-4c4d-82f1-993e568eabc0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"たしか ts-unused-exports って「そのプロジェクトのどこからも使われてない」を検出するくんだった気がします。","ts":"1629872492.142000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xf3Zz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d61e3861-1857-44d1-9d8a-d41678e3aa7b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"まあいずれにせよ `mod.ts` のunused exportとかが怒られかねないので特別扱いするファイルを定めたりする必要はありそう","ts":"1629872478.141300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vxp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b939f10-50f9-43d2-83ec-26e717a5aa7e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Deno、内部で色々な情報抱えてると思うのでダンプできるインターフェースが欲しい","ts":"1629872472.141000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kih1D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c90d6e86-394b-4480-8c0a-45d7d1a25962","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"少なくともunusedに関してはプロジェクト全体を見てる感じはしないんですよね\nそれこそ「exportしてるけどどこからも使われてない」がスルーされてるので","ts":"1629872434.139500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desuyone","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ypJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9252a16b-5e08-40b2-b72d-93b6980124dc","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ts-unused-exports が使えるならいけるかもしれないですね。","ts":"1629872433.139400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LVEHu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4EB0DCDB-11AF-431A-84EC-5975A5D0E4E4","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"go mod vendor すると、 node_modules っぽくも扱えますけどね","ts":"1629873740.171700","thread_ts":"1629873658.168800","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y2k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"030fb924-98c8-4e86-8bef-f059b0eed929","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"へぇー(知らなかった)","ts":"1629874448.175700","thread_ts":"1629873658.168800","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XtS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86cdf0aa-d23a-4e11-a2f2-a362bdb8ec8f","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`deno lint` の適用単位（閲覧範囲？）はわからないです :bow:","ts":"1629872394.138200","edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1629872404.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mq1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba049ae6-b7d7-4f1b-a10f-0a0ec939dd69","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`deno lint` 側が `deps.ts` を特別扱いするなら検出できそうですねぇ","ts":"1629872381.137900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6ZBif"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d440ad59-7648-412e-870d-7a90f9e019cb","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"少なくとも自分はそういう理解でいるんですけど","ts":"1629872367.137600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0S2uj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8793c304-440a-46db-b2a8-33f5e338439c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"`deno lint` はファイル単位でしか検査しないんでしたっけ","ts":"1629872354.137200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AJqva"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c419d930-bf9a-4d5d-b9db-5566bfcc02a4","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"検出したいのは「`deps.ts` で `export` してるけど、プロジェクト内部のどの `*.ts` ファイルからも参照されてないもの」なので","ts":"1629872330.136700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c/t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b47e99af-172e-416d-bba5-58fc3353cec0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そもそもの流れが読めてなかった気がしてます、すみません\ndeps.tsはpackage.jsonみたいな文脈って意味であってます？","ts":"1629872325.136500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gso19"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44b58dc6-5f39-4f72-bade-1be91700d336","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"普通のファイルで `export` してる場合は「外部公開」ですが `deps.ts` での `export` は「内部公開」的な側面が強いので検出が難しい","ts":"1629872270.135500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uKNy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4669a188-38d7-420d-8aa7-e9583099c990","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`deps.ts` を特別扱いしない限り難しいかと","ts":"1629872236.134700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jk6L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ea56bc9-99f2-4af6-bbbb-129b0ac81815","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これdenoに使えないのかな\n\u003chttps://www.npmjs.com/package/ts-unused-exports\u003e","ts":"1629872148.134300","attachments":[{"fallback":"npm: ts-unused-exports","id":1,"title":"ts-unused-exports","title_link":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/ts-unused-exports","text":"ts-unused-exports finds unused exported symbols in your Typescript project","thumb_url":"https://static.npmjs.com/338e4905a2684ca96e08c7780fc68412.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"npm","service_icon":"https://static.npmjs.com/58a19602036db1daee0d7863c94673a4.png","thumb_width":1200,"thumb_height":630,"from_url":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/ts-unused-exports","original_url":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/ts-unused-exports"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pMJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"146eb78d-1529-4b4b-a3b5-046efbd10ceb","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"なので `export` を使った時点で deno lint に引っかからなくなるから `deps.ts` を使うとそういうのチェックできなくなって辛いねという話かと","ts":"1629872055.134100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fpxE+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bd973d8-f853-491c-8f48-b79fdb90a59a","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C025RG58AAE/p1629850702129700\u003e\n\nこれ `deps.ts` で `export` しないモジュールは存在価値が無い気が...他のモジュールで使うために `deps.ts` に `export ... from \"...\";` の形で記載すると思うので...","ts":"1629872002.133400","thread_ts":"1629872002.133400","attachments":[{"fallback":"[August 24th, 2021 5:18 PM] sunmeasure1810.exe: deps.tsでもimportだけしてexportなどに使っていなければ警告は出るのではないでしょうか","id":1,"author_id":"U0238G3KV8D","author_name":"kawarimidoll","author_subname":"kawarimidoll","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U0238G3KV8D","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2021-05-28/2126244659505_6f9586613b2d5c0ab9eb_48.png","text":"deps.tsでもimportだけしてexportなどに使っていなければ警告は出るのではないでしょうか","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #tech-deno","ts":1629850702.129700,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C025RG58AAE/p1629850702129700","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C025RG58AAE/p1629850702129700"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Id"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80ae5545-fbab-4f6a-a0f4-79927ac03e01","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"これ、私もそうなんですが、node の黎明期、node 製のツールを試してみたいだけで、今手元の node とは違うバージョンを要求されて辛い という体験が私にはありましたね\n流行り廃りが早すぎる…","ts":"1629871879.132200","thread_ts":"1629796208.097500","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Joc"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"7ee938c9-8f99-4d24-b43a-e73ca0461a47","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"npmのglobal installが物凄く嫌い","ts":"1629796208.097500","thread_ts":"1629796208.097500","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0bvLa"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"2cb0a331-829f-44b5-8cf1-650cea76ffb3","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"「deps.tsでimport \u0026amp; exportしてるけど他のファイルで使っていない」ということでしょうか\nでも「モジュールとして公開してるけど同リポジトリ内では使っていない値」もありえるので、そこで警告が出てしまうと使いづらくなりそうに思えます","ts":"1629850974.131500","edited":{"user":"U0238G3KV8D","ts":"1629850999.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WpDsY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"352d8758-4e6a-45d4-bdf7-36b740480bf2","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"deps.tsでもimportだけしてexportなどに使っていなければ警告は出るのではないでしょうか","ts":"1629850702.129700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QOc"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02BNU5PPFY","text":"\u003c@U02BNU5PPFY\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1629849163.127400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"acadd6a7-03c1-43c6-bf47-f455cb0cc27f","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"なんか自分の言葉が足りなかった感ありますが その後のお話（deps.tsを特別扱いしないと…）的に多分認識はあってると思います:+1:","ts":"1629876317.176100","thread_ts":"1629872002.133400","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]},{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4jn5"}]}]
